{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29422","headline":"无题四首 二 · 李商隐","name":"无题四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飒飒东风细雨来，芙蓉塘外有轻雷。\n金蟾啮鏁烧香入，玉虎牵丝汲井回。\n贾氏窥帘韩掾少，宓妃留枕魏王才。\n春心莫共花争发，一寸相思一寸灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}